camerabin: capture caps before READY on GStreamer 0.10 (N9 camera)

Nokia's camerabin2 (camsrcbin with subdevsrc2) deadlocked going to PLAYING once any capture
caps property (viewfinder, image, video or audio caps, even an unchanged one) had been set
in READY, which start() always did: the GUI thread waited in subdevsrc2's ISP configure
(gst_task_join) for a task that needed a pad lock the GUI thread held. The camera never
left StartingStatus. With 0.10, load() now applies the caps in NULL, before READY; start()
sets only changed ones and, if any changed, reloads the pipeline instead (reproduced and
checked outside Qt with tests/gstprobe).

